  "note": "Reviewed SRD 5.2 patches. The advancement module adds a new file. The weapon-mastery patch makes mastery a CHOSEN weapon kind (SRD 5.2 Weapon Mastery) instead of a property of the weapon, so a fighter who chose nothing earns nothing; it also threads the choice from the derived sheet through the party spec into the combatant. | 2026-10-24: periods_covered/recover_item_and_activity_pools ported from work/nat20-engine a9b8479 | 2026-10-26: activities context/damage/dice/formula patched so class-feature formulas that use parenthesised dice counts, multiplication and @item.uses/@attributes.hd/@spells.pact tokens actually resolve (Preserve Life, Overchannel, Lifedrinker, Eldritch Smite, Divine Smite vs undead). | 2026-10-26: loader falls back to canonical_2014 when a category has no 2024 document, so SRD 5.1 subclasses/features stay loadable alongside the 2024 corpus. | 2026-10-26: SRD translator tooling declares the laaru import fixes (foundry.py, regen.py); they do not run at game time.",
